        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- The Salem, Wilsonville Correctional Officer's list will be combined between the two (2) Transport offices. The area of responsibility for these two (2) offices will be Salem, Portland Metro Area. The Area of responsibility for the Umatilla office will be Hermiston, Umatilla, Pendleton, Southeast Washington. The area of responsibility for the Ontario office will be Ontario and Southwest Idaho.",
